DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
13721::$$$message_0110_0000_0000$$$::[line len=3]It's revenge.[lr]::
13722::$$$message_0110_0000_0001$$$::The Tohsaka house cleaning strategy that I couldn't accomplish by myself, the long-awaited revenge...!::
13723::$$$message_0110_0001_0000$$$::"All right, [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-3][wshock canskip=0]four people is perfect."[lr]::
13724::$$$message_0110_0001_0001$$$::"There's two soldiers in the advance guard, and two mages in the rearguard."[lr]::
13725::$$$message_0110_0001_0002$$$::"This is like an attack formation. I wonder if I should've been a cleric..."::
13726::$$$message_0110_0002_0000$$$::"Do not worry. There is Rider and I.[lr]::
13727::$$$message_0110_0002_0001$$$::We will not let you or Shirou be in danger."::
13728::$$$message_0110_0003_0000$$$::They're talking as if we're going on a journey instead of cleaning.[lr]::
13729::$$$message_0110_0003_0001$$$::As we're talking about such things, I start to feel like this house is some magic castle where evil spirits from mountains and rivers dwell.::
13730::$$$message_0110_0004_0000$$$::"However, this aura... [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服13a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 storage=セイバー私服13a(中) time=300]It reminds me of my past when I fought evil spirits that haunted old castles. It makes me tingle with excitement."[lr]::
13731::$$$message_0110_0004_0001$$$::"...It is rare for you to be this fired up.[lr]::
13732::$$$message_0110_0004_0002$$$::I also felt something nostalgic from this mansion like the home that I am accustomed to."[lr]::
13733::$$$message_0110_0004_0003$$$::"But monsters living in the Tohsaka house[line len=2]"[lr]::
13734::$$$message_0110_0004_0004$$$::"...No, there's gotta be some, like one in particular."::
13735::$$$message_0110_0005_0000$$$::...It's starting to seem more and more like a dungeon.[lr]::
13736::$$$message_0110_0005_0001$$$::Like a dragon guarding treasure, or a giant, or any demon on that level.::
13737::$$$message_0110_0006_0000$$$::"...Now, there is no need to have a long chat here."[lr]::
13738::$$$message_0110_0006_0001$$$::"Oh, I have the key.[lr]::
13739::$$$message_0110_0006_0002$$$::[chgfg storage=桜私服08d(中) textoff=0 time=300]Umm, to break the seal..."::
13740::$$$message_0110_0007_0000$$$::"Sakura, calm down and do as I taught you. It should not be something that difficult for you now."[lr]::
13741::$$$message_0110_0007_0001$$$::"Y-Yeah, I'm okay...!"::
13742::$$$message_0110_0008_0000$$$::"There it goes. Let's go, Shirou."::
13743::$$$message_0110_0009_0000$$$::"Go ahead, Sakura."[lr]::
13744::$$$message_0110_0009_0001$$$::Rider pushes Sakura's shoulders.[lr]::
13745::$$$message_0110_0009_0002$$$::"Yes, um... [cacheimage storage=桜私服08c(遠)][wvl][chgfg storage=桜私服08c(遠) pos=rc time=300 textoff=0]E-Excuse me."::
13746::$$$message_0110_0010_0000$$$::"Do you not mean, 'I'm back home'?"[lr]::
13747::$$$message_0110_0010_0001$$$::"I was thinking that is only for Senpai's home."[lr]::
13748::$$$message_0110_0010_0002$$$::"[line len=3]Yes, then I shall also excuse myself.[lr]::
13749::$$$message_0110_0010_0003$$$::...[chgfg storage=ライダー私服01a(中) time=300]?"[lr]::
13750::$$$message_0110_0010_0004$$$::Rider who came in last looks at the entrance.::
13751::$$$message_0110_0011_0000$$$::"Oh... Senpai, there are signs that the door has been fixed. I feel like the tiles seem to be dirty too...?"[lr]::
13752::$$$message_0110_0011_0001$$$::"Hm? Yeah, isn't it fine if it's fixed?[lr]::
13753::$$$message_0110_0011_0002$$$::We're going to clean the tiles, so it's good timing."[lr]::
13754::$$$message_0110_0011_0003$$$::The tiles at the entrance have slight speckles of milk.::
13755::$$$message_0110_0012_0000$$$::"Oh, then I will clean the kitchen."::
13756::$$$message_0110_0013_0000$$$::"Then we shall do some physical labor."[lr]::
13757::$$$message_0110_0013_0001$$$::Rider takes out an apron.[lr]::
13758::$$$message_0110_0013_0002$$$::"Thanks. You'll get dirty from the dust so you should change too, Saber."[lr]::
13759::$$$message_0110_0013_0003$$$::"Yes, then I shall get ready over there."::
13760::$$$message_0110_0014_0000$$$::...All right.[lr]::
13761::$$$message_0110_0014_0001$$$::We're cleaning the Tohsaka house that's this big. Even if we have four people, we still have to roll up our sleeves.[lr]::
13762::$$$message_0110_0014_0002$$$::"[line len=3]Thank you for waiting.[lr]::
13763::$$$message_0110_0014_0003$$$::Then, where shall we start from?"::
13764::$$$message_0110_0015_0000$$$::"...Well, we're done with our skit of exploring the magic castle."[lr]::
13765::$$$message_0110_0015_0001$$$::"Is there a custom of arming oneself up before cleaning in ancient England?"[lr]::
13766::$$$message_0110_0015_0002$$$::"No, this is an admonition towards myself.[lr]::
13767::$$$message_0110_0015_0003$$$::This is a mage's workshop, so we do not know what kind of danger is lurking here.[lr]::
13768::$$$message_0110_0015_0004$$$::Once upon a time, I had to pay for it at my guardian's workshop. [cacheimage storage=セイバー鎧15a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー鎧15a(中)]Ever since then, I have taken the lesson to heart."::
13769::$$$message_0110_0016_0000$$$::I wonder how much Saber had to pay for her to become this fully armed... She must've gone through a lot.[lr]::
13770::$$$message_0110_0016_0001$$$::"Also, to not steal any food no matter what.[lr]::
13771::$$$message_0110_0016_0002$$$::The moment I ate, I prepared myself for death when not water torture but syrup torture started."[lr]::
13772::$$$message_0110_0016_0003$$$::"...You brought that on yourself."::
13773::$$$message_0110_0017_0000$$$::"...Shirou."[lr]::
13774::$$$message_0110_0017_0001$$$::Rider brings her lips to my ear and whispers.[lr]::
13775::$$$message_0110_0017_0002$$$::"What, Rider?"[lr]::
13776::$$$message_0110_0017_0003$$$::"If Saber loiters around the mansion, then she may break the furniture."[lr]::
13777::$$$message_0110_0017_0004$$$::"Yeah, the one that paid for wandering about inside the workshop might've been the court mage."::
13778::$$$message_0110_0018_0000$$$::"...Oh, hey Saber, hold on."[lr]::
13779::$$$message_0110_0018_0001$$$::"What is it?"[lr]::
13780::$$$message_0110_0018_0002$$$::"About how we divide up the chores, I want to ask you to clean the basement.[lr]::
13781::$$$message_0110_0018_0003$$$::Rider and I will clean the first floor."[lr]::
13782::$$$message_0110_0018_0004$$$::"Understood. I shall obey your orders."::
13783::$$$message_0110_0019_0000$$$::...All right. There would be nothing to break in a place that's made of stone like that.[lr]::
13784::$$$message_0110_0019_0001$$$::Rider and I discreetly sigh in relief.::
13785::$$$message_0110_0020_0000$$$::"We should probably move this over to here."[lr]::
13786::$$$message_0110_0020_0001$$$::"Got it, then can you take it over[line len=3]there?"[lr]::
13787::$$$message_0110_0020_0002$$$::She picks up a sofa that seats three people easily like a big prop for a play.::
13788::$$$message_0110_0021_0000$$$::"It helps to have you help out, Rider."[lr]::
13789::$$$message_0110_0021_0001$$$::"...I am a big woman that has a lot of strength after all."[lr]::
13790::$$$message_0110_0021_0002$$$::"Yeah, I appreciate that.[lr]::
13791::$$$message_0110_0021_0003$$$::All right, [wvl][se storage=se676.wav]I think I'll do the floor."[lr]::
13792::$$$message_0110_0021_0004$$$::"Should I be cleaning the furniture with a cloth?"::
13793::$$$message_0110_0022_0000$$$::"...I'm not sure. They all look like antiques, so let's ask Sakura about how we should handle the furnishings."[lr]::
13794::$$$message_0110_0022_0001$$$::"Understood... [wvl][se storage=se677.wav]Also Shirou, what have you been scattering?"[lr]::
13795::$$$message_0110_0022_0002$$$::"Used tea leaves."[lr]::
13796::$$$message_0110_0022_0003$$$::"Tea leaves?"::
13797::$$$message_0110_0023_0000$$$::"Yeah, hair that falls onto the carpet is [wvl][se storage=se677.wav]hard to remove, right?"[lr]::
13798::$$$message_0110_0023_0001$$$::"Yes."[lr]::
13799::$$$message_0110_0023_0002$$$::"You scatter the dried tea leaves like this and suck those up with a vacuum.[wvs][sestop storage=se675.wav time=3000 nowait=1][lr]::
13800::$$$message_0110_0023_0003$$$::And... See? The hair will come off with the tea leaves, right?"[lr]::
13801::$$$message_0110_0023_0004$$$::"I see, that is some life wisdom."[wvs][sestop storage=se675.wav time=4000 nowait=1]::
13802::$$$message_0110_0024_0000$$$::Just like that, the cleaning moves along smoothly and peacefully in the living room.[lr]::
13803::$$$message_0110_0024_0001$$$::I can be at ease leaving the kitchen to Sakura.[lr]::
13804::$$$message_0110_0024_0002$$$::...So... All that's left is Saber who went to the basement, but...::
13805::$$$message_0110_0025_0000$$$::"...This is...[lr]::
13806::$$$message_0110_0025_0001$$$::...Yes, I have heard from Rin before. [wvs][sestop time=400 nowait=1][lr]::
13807::$$$message_0110_0025_0002$$$::That she tried to summon me here before the Holy Grail War started[line len=3]"::
13808::$$$message_0110_0026_0000$$$::"However, Archer is the one that was summoned.[lr]::
13809::$$$message_0110_0026_0001$$$::...I wonder what Rin used as a catalyst?"::
13810::$$$message_0110_0027_0000$$$::"...???"::
13811::$$$message_0110_0028_0000$$$::"A dumbbell? A punching bag? An expander?[lr]::
13812::$$$message_0110_0028_0001$$$::...This is...[delay speed=250]the summoning catalyst[delay speed=user]?"::
13813::$$$message_0110_0029_0000$$$::"...Mrgh. I wonder what kind of intention Rin had trying to summon a Servant...[lr]::
13814::$$$message_0110_0029_0001$$$::There's an open, family size protein bag in a place like this... Is this creatine? Amino acids?[lr]::
13815::$$$message_0110_0029_0002$$$::Then, the Saber that Rin imagined was[line len=3]"::
13816::$$$message_0110_0030_0000$$$::"..."::
13817::$$$message_0110_0031_0000$$$::"...How unfortunate, Rin.[lr]::
13818::$$$message_0110_0031_0001$$$::It seems like we were just not meant to be.[lr]::
13819::$$$message_0110_0031_0002$$$::As a result of using this as a catalyst, it makes sense that the muscular Archer was summoned."::
13820::$$$message_0110_0032_0000$$$::"However, could it be...that she thought that I love to exercise?[lr]::
13821::$$$message_0110_0032_0001$$$::That she thought Sabers lift barbells like this every day..."::
13822::$$$message_0110_0033_0000$$$::"..."::
13823::$$$message_0110_0034_0000$$$::"...Phew.[lr]::
13824::$$$message_0110_0034_0001$$$::Swords are not something that you swing with strength.[lr]::
13825::$$$message_0110_0034_0002$$$::Power is within one's Noble Phantasm, so using unnecessary strength would instead be a hindrance."::
13826::$$$message_0110_0035_0000$$$::"Yes, if it was this treadmill..."::
13827::$$$message_0110_0036_0000$$$::"Mrgh, this is an exercise bike, this is a Bodyblade, and an exercise ball...[lr]::
13828::$$$message_0110_0036_0001$$$::Oh, there is even a power tower, then I shall[line len=2]"[lr]::
13829::$$$message_0110_0036_0002$$$::"Saber, what are you doing?"::
13830::$$$message_0110_0037_0000$$$::"Saber, what are you doing?"[lr]::
13831::$$$message_0110_0037_0001$$$::I call to her.[lr]::
13832::$$$message_0110_0037_0002$$$::...Well. I seem to be interrupting her while she's having fun playing around.::
13833::$$$message_0110_0038_0000$$$::"...Shirou, this is[line len=2]"[lr]::
13834::$$$message_0110_0038_0001$$$::"..."::
13835::$$$message_0110_0039_0000$$$::"This is the catalyst that Rin left behind.[lr]::
13836::$$$message_0110_0039_0001$$$::I was investigating each item one by one to make sure they're not affecting the world negatively after soaking in magical energy and transforming.[lr]::
13837::$$$message_0110_0039_0002$$$::At mages' workshops, there are times when items gain their own will with magical energy and attack intruders[line len=3]"[lr]::
13838::$$$message_0110_0039_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
13839::$$$message_0110_0039_0004$$$::I imagine the bizarre scenario of me being attacked by a power tower.[lr]::
13840::$$$message_0110_0039_0005$$$::...I don't have the confidence that I would be able to come back alive.::
13841::$$$message_0110_0040_0000$$$::"...Well, Saber. That's Tohsaka's training equipment. It's not being used as a catalyst or as magecraft materials."[lr]::
13842::$$$message_0110_0040_0001$$$::"...Is that true?"::
13843::$$$message_0110_0041_0000$$$::"She must be using this as a storage room, since she doesn't do any large-scale rituals anymore."[lr]::
13844::$$$message_0110_0041_0001$$$::"...Oh."[lr]::
13845::$$$message_0110_0041_0002$$$::"Huh?"::
13846::$$$message_0110_0042_0000$$$::"Then I will continue cleaning here. I just have to put this training equipment into one place, correct?"[lr]::
13847::$$$message_0110_0042_0001$$$::"Yeah. No need to go overboard with the basement.[lr]::
13848::$$$message_0110_0042_0002$$$::I was gonna ask you to clean outside too, but should I help?"[lr]::
13849::$$$message_0110_0042_0003$$$::"No, I am fine by myself.[lr]::
13850::$$$message_0110_0042_0004$$$::Please take care of the inside of the house, Shirou."::
13851::$$$message_0110_0043_0000$$$::She bows towards me, and I nod.[lr]::
13852::$$$message_0110_0043_0001$$$::All right, next is[line len=3]Tohsaka's room maybe?::
13853::$$$message_0110_0044_0000$$$::"...Sakura?"[lr]::
13854::$$$message_0110_0044_0001$$$::Sakura is reading something in Tohsaka's room.[lr]::
13855::$$$message_0110_0044_0002$$$::She must've noticed that I came, as she hides whatever she was reading.[clfg textoff=0 time=300 pos=all]::
13856::$$$message_0110_0045_0000$$$::"What were you reading, Sakura?"[lr]::
13857::$$$message_0110_0045_0001$$$::"I-I wasn't looking for Nee-san's diary or anything.[lr]::
13858::$$$message_0110_0045_0002$$$::As I was fixing the bed sheets, some letter in English came out, so I couldn't help but get curious and skim it."[lr]::
13859::$$$message_0110_0045_0003$$$::"That can't be helped. Tohsaka was careless for not storing her letters. But an English letter, you said?"::
13860::$$$message_0110_0046_0000$$$::"Yes, it's this..."[lr]::
13861::$$$message_0110_0046_0001$$$::What Sakura showed me was an envelope that had the airmail border.::
13862::$$$message_0110_0047_0000$$$::"Oh, it's from overseas. Who was it from?"[lr]::
13863::$$$message_0110_0047_0001$$$::"Um... From..."[lr]::
13864::$$$message_0110_0047_0002$$$::"Oof, isn't that..."[lr]::
13865::$$$message_0110_0047_0003$$$::...The airmail was a letter from the Mage's Association.[lr]::
13866::$$$message_0110_0047_0004$$$::Tohsaka is a mage who is an administrator of these lands, so it's not odd that she's directly receiving directions or orders.::
13867::$$$message_0110_0048_0000$$$::"Nee-san has it hard too.[lr]::
13868::$$$message_0110_0048_0001$$$::See, she has this many letters and books spread out."[lr]::
13869::$$$message_0110_0048_0002$$$::"...She's gonna eventually lose some."[lr]::
13870::$$$message_0110_0048_0003$$$::There's a pile of opened envelopes and writing paper stacked up.::
13871::$$$message_0110_0049_0000$$$::"Kiritsugu didn't get anything... I guess that's obvious since he was freelance."[lr]::
13872::$$$message_0110_0049_0001$$$::"They didn't come to my place either, Nee-san really is impressive..."::
13873::$$$message_0110_0050_0000$$$::Sakura puts the letter back in the envelope and slides it back inside the bed like it was before.[lr]::
13874::$$$message_0110_0050_0001$$$::She's being considerate, but if that's the case, I feel like she should just leave it on the desk.::
13875::$$$message_0110_0051_0000$$$::"Oh, I need to write a letter to Nee-san... [cacheimage storage=桜私服06a(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 storage=桜私服06a(中) time=300]I promised her."[lr]::
13876::$$$message_0110_0051_0001$$$::"Like updating her on the current situation?"::
13877::$$$message_0110_0052_0000$$$::"Yes, she told me to let her know if anything happens.[lr]::
13878::$$$message_0110_0052_0001$$$::I'll write it, so do you have any message for Nee-san, Senpai?"[lr]::
13879::$$$message_0110_0052_0002$$$::"Oof... That's really putting me on the spot.[lr]::
13880::$$$message_0110_0052_0003$$$::Can I give you a message later, Sakura?"::
13881::$$$message_0110_0053_0000$$$::"Yes, got it.[lr]::
13882::$$$message_0110_0053_0001$$$::I'll write it once we finish eating dinner, so please come to my room then."::
13883::$$$message_0110_0054_0000$$$::We casually make a promise to deliver a message to a distant foreign country.[lr]::
13884::$$$message_0110_0054_0001$$$::I leave Tohsaka's room to Sakura, and I head toward the hallway to work on the guestroom next door...[lr]::
13885::$$$message_0110_0054_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
13886::$$$message_0110_0054_0003$$$::I notice that Sakura is looking at Tohsaka's room with a nostalgic look.::
13887::$$$message_0110_0055_0000$$$::"Sakura?"[lr]::
13888::$$$message_0110_0055_0001$$$::"...Oh. [cacheimage storage=桜私服03d(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=桜私服03d(中)]I'm sorry, Senpai, this atmosphere was so nostalgic that I got lost in my thoughts."[lr]::
13889::$$$message_0110_0055_0002$$$::"...I see. Do you remember the past?"::
13890::$$$message_0110_0056_0000$$$::"The thing is, I mostly don't remember anything.[lr]::
13891::$$$message_0110_0056_0001$$$::It seems like I had my own room in the past, but it's gone now."::
13892::$$$message_0110_0057_0000$$$::"...I see."[lr]::
13893::$$$message_0110_0057_0001$$$::"Oh, but[line len=3]"[lr]::
13894::$$$message_0110_0057_0002$$$::Sakura picks up the photo frame from the table.::
13895::$$$message_0110_0058_0000$$$::"I remember this."[lr]::
13896::$$$message_0110_0058_0001$$$::"Tohsaka gave you your hair tie, right?"[lr]::
13897::$$$message_0110_0058_0002$$$::I heard that the ribbon that Sakura has in her hair is what Tohsaka had on.::
13898::$$$message_0110_0059_0000$$$::"It was Nee-san's favorite ribbon that she made herself.[lr]::
13899::$$$message_0110_0059_0001$$$::Hair and hair ties are the final trump cards of a female mage, so she made a special one."[lr]::
13900::$$$message_0110_0059_0002$$$::"So you got that when you parted with Tohsaka."[lr]::
13901::$$$message_0110_0059_0003$$$::"Yes, Nee-san tied my hair with it."::
13902::$$$message_0110_0060_0000$$$::...I see.[lr]::
13903::$$$message_0110_0060_0001$$$::Tohsaka gave her most important remnant to her little sister who she could never see again[line len=3][lr]::
13904::$$$message_0110_0060_0002$$$::"...Tohsaka isn't usually honest..."::
13905::$$$message_0110_0061_0000$$$::"And she said the payment is a cheap 3 carat emerald, up to 3% annual interest rate, and that she'll let me pay in installments as a bonus."[lr]::
13906::$$$message_0110_0061_0001$$$::"She's really greedy even at times like that... Wait, [wvl][fadebgm time=200 volume=30][shock vmax=20 time=1200 count=20]whatttt!!!???"[lr]::
13907::$$$message_0110_0061_0002$$$::I didn't know Tohsaka was a miser from such an age!::
13908::$$$message_0110_0062_0000$$$::"I thought about it as a child.[lr]::
13909::$$$message_0110_0062_0001$$$::If it was a compound interest of 3% annual interest, then I wondered whether it would be worth 4 carat or 5 carat. Or whether the number of installments were twelve times or twenty-four times a year, whether early repayment is possible, whether I could convert it to diamonds[line len=3]"::
13910::$$$message_0110_0063_0000$$$::"[shock vmax=20 time=400 count=-3]Wait, why does it turn into all that talk about loans!?"::
13911::$$$message_0110_0064_0000$$$::"Oh, Nee-san was always like that from before."[lr]::
13912::$$$message_0110_0064_0001$$$::"...F-Freaking Tohsaka. What an awful person. I hadn't even gotten a taste of a tenth of her awfulness[line len=3]"[lr]::
13913::$$$message_0110_0064_0002$$$::"Hehe. However, that's not it, Senpai."[lr]::
13914::$$$message_0110_0064_0003$$$::It's a tough topic, yet Sakura's smile is playful.::
13915::$$$message_0110_0065_0000$$$::"You see.[lr]::
13916::$$$message_0110_0065_0001$$$::Nee-san makes the people who are more important to her owe her more things."[lr]::
13917::$$$message_0110_0065_0002$$$::"Huh?"::
13918::$$$message_0110_0066_0000$$$::"If she had only given me this as a present, then that's it.[lr]::
13919::$$$message_0110_0066_0001$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 storage=桜私服01c(中) time=300]Nee-san didn't like that.[lr]::
13920::$$$message_0110_0066_0002$$$::Because she cared about me, she gave me such a large loan."::
13921::$$$message_0110_0067_0000$$$::"When she told me very seriously that I need to return it no matter what, it made me think.[lr]::
13922::$$$message_0110_0067_0001$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 storage=桜私服08c(中) time=300]Oh, Nee-san will always remember me, so the loan is so big that I can never return it."::
13923::$$$message_0110_0068_0000$$$::"That's why I think Nee-san is also making you owe her many things, too."[lr]::
13924::$$$message_0110_0068_0001$$$::"I-I see... I felt bad thinking that I was always causing her trouble by being indebted to her..."::
13925::$$$message_0110_0069_0000$$$::"Oh, it'd be more impressive to have her be indebted to you.[lr]::
13926::$$$message_0110_0069_0001$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 storage=桜私服06a(中) time=300]She doesn't approve of lukewarm loans unless you have a signed and sealed IOU."::
13927::$$$message_0110_0070_0000$$$::I feel like you'd need to form a notarized deed or a court ruling or something...when having someone like Tohsaka in your debt.::
13928::$$$message_0110_0071_0000$$$::"I need to get myself together more, and I want to say,[cacheimage storage=桜私服08k(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 storage=桜私服08k(中) time=200] 'You owe me, Nee-san!'[lr]::
13929::$$$message_0110_0071_0001$$$::[chgfg storage=桜私服03e(中) time=300]at least once."[lr]::
13930::$$$message_0110_0071_0002$$$::"...I'm sure that'll happen soon. Don't tell Tohsaka that we talked about this, okay?"[lr]::
13931::$$$message_0110_0071_0003$$$::"Yes, Nee-san will probably get mad if she finds out."::
13932::$$$message_0110_0072_0000$$$::We both laugh a bit.[lr]::
13933::$$$message_0110_0072_0001$$$::I feel like I understand Tohsaka's complicated parts a bit more.[lr]::
13934::$$$message_0110_0072_0002$$$::[line len=3]Then...::
13935::$$$message_0110_0073_0000$$$::"There is something I would like to ask you, Sakura[line len=3]"[lr]::
13936::$$$message_0110_0073_0001$$$::"Oh...[cacheimage storage=桜私服08h(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 storage=桜私服08h(中) time=300]that's right, we have to keep on cleaning!"[lr]::
13937::$$$message_0110_0073_0002$$$::"Shoot, we won't get things done even if we keep going until the sun sets..."[lr]::
13938::$$$message_0110_0073_0003$$$::"Let's get this over with then, Senpai!"::
13939::$$$message_0110_0074_0000$$$::"[line len=3]Anfung Mittelstand."::
13940::$$$message_0110_0075_0000$$$::"...Did it go well, Rider?"[lr]::
13941::$$$message_0110_0075_0001$$$::"Yes, well done."[lr]::
13942::$$$message_0110_0075_0002$$$::The long Tohsaka house cleaning has finished.::
13943::$$$message_0110_0076_0000$$$::"Thank you for all your hard work today, everyone!"[lr]::
13944::$$$message_0110_0076_0001$$$::"Sorry for making you three help out."[lr]::
13945::$$$message_0110_0076_0002$$$::"No worries. You too, Shirou, good work today."[lr]::
13946::$$$message_0110_0076_0003$$$::"Yes. You were helping out in every area everyone was in charge of." ::
13947::$$$message_0110_0077_0000$$$::We leave the deserted Tohsaka house.[lr]::
13948::$$$message_0110_0077_0001$$$::I don't know when the owner of the mansion will come back, but until then, we need to keep this house clean.::
913723::$$$message_9110_0001_0000$$$::"All right, four people is perfect."[r]���